    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't know if a crisis line is gonna fix the fact that nothing matters. i just keep thinking about how quiet it would be if i just... stopped. and the weird part is, it doesn't even feel scary. it just feels like a relief. like, if i just went away, the quiet would stay quiet and nobody would have to deal with me or my \"weight\" anymore. it's like it would just be a very peaceful, silent end to everything.",
