      "content": "That sense of relief you're feeling is the exhaustion talking, and it's a very powerful feeling when you're this drained. The peace you imagine is just the silence of giving up, and you deserve a different kind of peace. Instead of ending things, could you let someone help you find a quiet place to rest right now? Please reach out to the National Suicide Prevention Lifeline at 988; they can sit with you in this quiet moment.",
